    "description": "New Price!! Welcome to 831-833 Arguello Boulevard, a rarely available duplex located in San Francisco's highly desirable Inner Richmond neighborhood. Combining timeless charm with modern upgrades, this two-unit property presents a unique opportunity for both investors and owner-occupants seeking a residence with income potential. Just steps from Golden Gate Park, the University of San Francisco, and neighborhood conveniences, the property offers a blend of comfort, functionality, and long-term value in one of the city's most sought-after communities. The duplex's central location places it within minutes of world-class healthcare facilities, including the University of California San Francisco (UCSF), California Pacific Medical Center (CPMC), and Saint Mary's Hospital. These nearby institutions not only provide peace of mind for residents but also create a steady demand for rental housing, further enhancing the property's investment appeal.  Investment Potential  For investors, 831-833 Arguello Boulevard offers stable rental income in a high-demand market. The two self-contained units provide flexibility. One unit will be delivered vacant at close of escrow."
